I have successfully updated the application to add the user profile editing functionality. Here is a summary of the corrections and changes:

### 1. Created Dedicated Edit Profile Screen
* Added a new page: [edit_profile.html](file:///c:/Users/asus/OneDrive/Desktop/IEEE/edit_profile.html) styled with the platform's premium glassmorphic dark theme and dynamic WebGL background.
* Integrates fully with Firebase Auth and Firestore to update:
  * **Profile Picture URL** (with live preview).
